1
00:00:00,359 --> 00:00:03,259
Sleep is cruel when pain is near.

2
00:00:04,360 --> 00:00:08,220
When gripped by fear, let darkness rule.

3
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:15,439
In dreams of light, a gilded fraud, we

4
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:18,059
drift in awe without our sight.

5
00:00:18,920 --> 00:00:20,340
We wake in dread.

6
00:00:20,979 --> 00:00:22,519
We ache inside.

7
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,399
We cannot hide.

8
00:00:24,979 --> 00:00:26,239
We stare ahead.

9
00:00:27,399 --> 00:00:31,619
Then we recall the lawless fact: it will

10
00:00:31,679 --> 00:00:37,039
not slack, it will not pause — until we

11
00:00:37,139 --> 00:00:37,639
sleep.

12
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:41,959
It starts again the moment when we take

13
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:42,680
the leap.

